error[unused_binding]: the loop variable `zero` is never read — write `for _ in …` when the element is not needed
  at tests/golden/full/fixedbugs-401-what-a-binding-called-zero-beside-the-words-is-told.hero:25:9
     |
  25 |     for zero in xs  #~ unused_binding
     |         ^^^^
  note: `rest: zero` at line 26 is not a read of this binding: the words end a construction of a group's `record`, every field it does not name zero, and read no name
  fix (guess): rename `zero` to `_`

error[rest_outside_a_group]: `Hr` is a Heroes `record`, and a construction of one names every field, always (§4.9): `rest: zero` ends only a construction of a group's `record`, whose layout is the header's
  at tests/golden/full/fixedbugs-401-what-a-binding-called-zero-beside-the-words-is-told.hero:33:18
     |
  33 |     h = Hr(a: 1, rest: zero)  #~ rest_outside_a_group
     |                  ^^^^^^^^^^
  note: name each field of `Hr` with its value, and write the value of its field `rest` as anything but the bare name `zero`: `rest: zero` is always the words, never that field

error[rest_outside_a_group]: `.ring` builds a case of a Heroes `variant`, and a construction of one names every field, always (§4.9): `rest: zero` ends only a construction of a group's `record`, whose layout is the header's
  at tests/golden/full/fixedbugs-401-what-a-binding-called-zero-beside-the-words-is-told.hero:34:28
     |
  34 |     s: Shape = .ring(r: 2, rest: zero)  #~ rest_outside_a_group
     |                            ^^^^^^^^^^
  note: name each field of `.ring` with its value, and write the value of a field called `rest` as anything but the bare name `zero`: `rest: zero` is always the words, never that field
